OL,3,GNEWSAFree bus travel being 'treated
OL,4,Alike childcare'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus driver has claimed free bus
OL,7,Ftravel for children has been treated
OL,8,Flike childcare this August.
OL,10,FChildren aged five to 15 are able to
OL,11,Ftravel on most bus services in England
OL,12,Ffor free, as part of a government
OL,13,Fscheme, which is due to run until the
OL,14,Fend of August.
OL,16,FBus driver Ian from Penkhull said he
OL,17,Fhad been in the job for more than 30
OL,18,Fyears and had seen more children using
OL,19,Fthe buses as a result of the offer.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
